eenly_qc.yml`","Consultar designs do Figma antes da implementação","Uso de kebab-case para nomes de aplicativos","Execução de `bun run dev` para desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Использование `bun create` для создания каркаса приложений","Настройка `screenly.yml` и `screenly_qc.yml`","Консультация дизайнов Figma перед реализацией","Использование kebab-case для названий приложений","Выполнение `bun run dev` для разработки"],"ar":["استخدام `bun create` لإنشاء هيكل التطبيقات","تكوين `screenly.yml` و `screenly_qc.yml`","استشارة التصاميم من Figma قبل التنفيذ","استخدام kebab-case لأسماء التطبيقات","تشغيل `bun run dev` للتطوير"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to create an edge app","create-an-edge-app setup guide","create-an-edge-app alternative","create-an-edge-app vs screenly","create-an-edge-app install","what is create-an-edge-app","create-an-edge-app tutorial","create-an-edge-app api documentation","create-an-edge-app examples"],"zh":["Edge应用创建","Screenly API","bun create模板","Figma设计","kebab-case命名约定","Edge应用开发","AIエージェント","Edge应用Setup Guide"],"ja":["Edgeアプリケーションを作成","Screenly APIエージェント","bun createテンプレート","Figmaデザイン","kebab-case命名規則","Edgeアプリケーション開発","AIエージェント","EdgeアプリケーションBest Practices"],"ko":["Edge 애플리케이션 생성","Screenly API","bun create 템플릿","Figma 디자인","kebab-case 명명 규칙","Edge 애플리케이션 개발","AI 에이전트","Edge 애플리케이션 가이드"],"es":["create-an-edge-app","Screenly","API de Screenly","aplicaciones Edge","desarrollo de aplicaciones","bun create","Figma designs","kebab-case"],"fr":["create-an-edge-app","Screenly","API de Screenly","applications Edge","développement d''applications","bun create","Figma designs","kebab-case"],"de":["create-an-edge-app","Screenly","Screenly-API","Edge-Anwendungen","Anwendungsentwicklung","bun create","Figma-Designs","kebab-case"],"pt":["criar aplicativo de borda","Screenly API","bun create","screenly.yml","Figma designs","desenvolvimento de aplicativos","kebab-case","bun run dev"],"ru":["создать приложение Edge","Screenly API","bun create","screenly.yml","Figma дизайны","разработка приложений ИИ Агентов","kebab-case","bun run dev"],"ar":["إنشاء تطبيق حافي","Screenly API","bun create","screenly.yml","تصاميم Figma","تطوير التطبيقات","kebab-case","bun run dev"]}},"owner":"Screenly","repo":"Playground","repoPath":"Screenly/Playground","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.296Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"create-an-edge-app","description":"The recommended way to create an Edge App","bodyPreview":"# Creating an Edge App\n\n## When Creating an Edge App\n\n- Scaffold the new Edge App using the `bun create` template from inside the `edge-apps/` directory:\n  ```bash\n  bun create edge-app-template --no-git <app-name>\n  ```\n  - The app name should follow the `kebab-case` naming convention.\n- After scaffolding, add an `id` field to `screenly.yml` and `screenly_qc.yml` before running `bun run dev`.\n- **Consult Figma designs** before starting implementation.\n  - Ensure the [Figma MCP server](https://m","body":"# Creating an Edge App\n\n## When Creating an Edge App\n\n- Scaffold the new Edge App using the `bun create` template from inside the `edge-apps/` directory:\n  ```bash\n  bun create edge-app-template --no-git <app-name>\n  ```\n  - The app name should follow the `kebab-case` naming convention.\n- After scaffolding, add an `id` field to `screenly.yml` and `screenly_qc.yml` before running `bun run dev`.\n- **Consult Figma designs** before starting implementation.\n  - Ensure the [Figma MCP server](https://mcp.figma.com/mcp) is set up in Claude Code.\n  - Use the Figma MCP server to access design specifications, mockups, and UI requirements.\n  - Extract design tokens such as colors, spacing, typography, and component specifications from Figma.\n  - Ensure the implementation matches the approved designs in Figma before proceeding with development.\n\n## Reference Apps\n\nFor reference on more complex implementations, consult:\n\n- QR Code (`edge-apps/qr-code/`) — simple, low-footprint example\n- Menu Board (`edge-apps/menu-board/`) — more complex layout\n- CAP Alerting (`edge-apps/cap-alerting/`) — advanced settings and data fetching\n\nAll apps depend on the `@screenly/edge-apps` library (`workspace:../edge-apps-library`) and use `edge-apps-scripts` for tooling.\n\n### About the Manifest Files\n\n- Add any app-specific settings under the `settings` key, sorted alphabetically.\n- More information about manifest files can be found in the [Edge Apps documentation in the `Screenly/cli` repository](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Screenly/cli/refs/heads/master/docs/EdgeApps.md).\n\n### About `index.html`\n\n- Organize HTML code into templates and Web Components as the app grows in complexity.\n- Use HTML content templates first for simpler structures.\n- Consider using Web Components for more complex UI components that require encapsulation and reusability.\n\n### About `README.md`\n\n- Include instructions on how to create, build, test, format, lint, and deploy the app.\n- Do not add details like the directory structure, as the code frequently changes.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:01:12.439Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Edge Computing Agents requiring customized Edge App development using Screenly and its API.","zh":"适用于需要使用 Screenly 和其 API 进行自定义 Edge App 开发的 Edge Computing Agents。","ja":"Screenly とその API を使用したカスタム Edge App 開発を必要とする Edge Computing Agents に適しています。","ko":"Screenly와そのAPI를사용한カスタムEdge App 개발을必要로하는 Edge Computing Agents에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de computación de borde que requieren un desarrollo de aplicaciones de borde personalizadas utilizando Screenly y su API.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de calcul de bord nécessitant un développement d''applications de bord personnalisées à l''aide de Screenly et de son API.","de":"Ideal für Edge-Computing-Agents, die eine benutzerdefinierte Edge-App-Entwicklung unter Verwendung von Screenly und seiner API erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Computação de Borda que requerem desenvolvimento de Aplicativos de Borda personalizados usando Screenly e sua API.","ru":"Идеально для агентов вычислений на краю сети, требующих настраиваемого разработки приложений для края сети с помощью Screenly и его API.","ar":"مثالي لعميل حوسبة الحافة الذي يتطلب تطوير تطبيقات حافة مخصصة باستخدام Screenly وواجهة برمجة التطبيقات الخاصة بها."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to scaffold new Edge Apps using the `bun create` template, integrate with Figma designs, and utilize the Screenly API for customized development, all while following the `kebab-case` naming convention.","zh":"赋予代理人使用 `bun create` 模板创建新 Edge Apps、集成 Figma 设计并利用 Screenly API 进行自定义开发的能力，所有操作都遵循 `kebab-case` 命名约定。","ja":"`bun create` テンプレートを使用して新しい Edge Apps を作成し、Figma デザインを統合し、Screenly API を使用してカスタム開発を行う機能をエージェントに与え、すべての操作で `kebab-case` 命名規則に従うことができます。","ko":"`bun create` 템플릿을 사용하여 새로운 Edge Apps를 생성하고, Figma 디자인을 통합하며, Screenly API를 사용하여 커스터마이즈 개발을 수행하는 기능을 에이전트에게 부여함으로써, 모든 동작에서 `kebab-case` 명명 규칙을 따를 수 있습니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear nuevos Edge Apps utilizando la plantilla `bun create`, integrar diseños de Figma y utilizar la API de Screenly para el desarrollo personalizado, siguiendo la convención de nomenclatura `kebab-case`.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer de nouvelles applications de bord à l''aide de la template `bun create`, d''intégrer des conceptions Figma et d''utiliser l''API Screenly pour le développement personnalisé, en suivant la convention de nommage `kebab-case`.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, neue Edge-Apps mit der `bun create`-Vorlage zu erstellen, Figma-Designs zu integrieren und die Screenly-API für die benutzerdefinierte Entwicklung zu nutzen, während sie die `kebab-case`-Benennungskonvention befolgen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar novos Aplicativos de Borda usando o modelo de template `bun create`, integrar com designs do Figma e utilizar a API do Screenly para desenvolvimento personalizado, todos seguindo a convenção de nomenclatura `kebab-case`.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать новые приложения для края сети с помощью шаблона `bun create`, интегрироваться с дизайнами Figma и использовать API Screenly для настраиваемого развития, все при этом следуя соглашению об именах `kebab-case`.","ar":"يمكن الوكيل من إنشاء تطبيقات حافة جديدة باستخدام قالب `bun create` ، ودمج تصاميم Figma ، واستخدام واجهة برمجة التطبيقات Screenly لتطوير مخصص ، كل ذلك متبعة اتفاقية تسمية `kebab-case`."},"useCases":{"en":["Scaffolding new Edge Apps with `bun create edge-app-template`","Integrating Figma designs into Edge App development","Customizing Edge Apps using the Screenly API"],"zh":["使用 `bun create edge-app-template` 创建新 Edge Apps","将 Figma 设计集成到 Edge App 开发中","使用 Screenly API 自定义 Edge Apps"],"ja":["`bun create edge-app-template` を使用して新しい Edge Apps を作成する","Figma デザインを Edge App 開発に統合する","Screenly API を使用して Edge Apps をカスタマイズする"],"ko":["`bun create edge-app-template`를 사용하여 새로운 Edge Apps를 생성하는 것","Figma 디자인을 Edge App 개발에 통합하는 것","Screenly API를 사용하여 Edge Apps를 커스터마이즈하는 것"],"es":["Creación de nuevos Edge Apps con `bun create edge-app-template`","Integración de diseños de Figma en el desarrollo de aplicaciones de borde","Personalización de aplicaciones de borde utilizando la API de Screenly"],"fr":["Création de nouvelles applications de bord avec `bun create edge-app-template`","Intégration de conceptions Figma dans le développement d''applications de bord","Personnalisation d''applications de bord à l''aide de l''API Screenly"],"de":["Erstellen neuer Edge-Apps mit `bun create edge-app-template`","Integration von Figma-Designs in die Edge-App-Entwicklung","Anpassung von Edge-Apps unter Verwendung der Screenly-API"],"pt":["Criação de novos Aplicativos de Borda com `bun create edge-app-template`","Integração de designs do Figma no desenvolvimento de Aplicativos de Borda","Personalização de Aplicativos de Borda usando a API do Screenly"],"ru":["Создание новых приложений для края сети с помощью `bun create edge-app-template`","Интеграция дизайнов Figma в разработку приложений для края сети","Настройка приложений для края сети с помощью API Screenly"],"ar":["إنشاء تطبيقات حافة جديدة باستخدام `bun create edge-app-template`","دمج تصاميم Figma في تطوير تطبيقات الحافة","تخصيص تطبيقات الحافة باستخدام واجهة برمجة التطبيقات Screenly"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires `bun` installation","Must follow `kebab-case` naming convention","Needs access to Figma designs and Screenly API"],"zh":["需要 `bun` 安装","必须遵循 `kebab-case` 命名约定","需要访问 Figma 设计和 Screenly API"],"ja":["`bun` のインストールが必要","`kebab-case` 命名規則に従う必要がある","Figma デザインと Screenly API にアクセスする必要がある"],"ko":["`bun` 설치가 필요함","`kebab-case` 명명 규칙을 따라야 함","Figma 디자인과 Screenly API에 접근할 수 있어야 함"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de `bun`","Debe seguir la convención de nomenclatura `kebab-case`","Necesita acceso a diseños de Figma y a la API de Screenly"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de `bun`","Doit suivre la convention de nommage `kebab-case`","Nécessite l''accès aux conceptions Figma et à l''API Screenly"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation von `bun`","Muss der `kebab-case`-Benennungskonvention folgen","Benötigt den Zugriff auf Figma-Designs und die Screenly-API"],"pt":["Exige instalação do `bun`","Deve seguir a convenção de nomenclatura `kebab-case`","Necessita acesso a designs do Figma e API do Screenly"],"ru":["Требует установки `bun`","Должно следовать соглашению об именах `kebab-case`","Требует доступа к дизайнам Figma и API Screenly"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت `bun`","يجب اتباع اتفاقية تسمية `kebab-case`","يتطلب الوصول إلى تصاميم Figma وواجهة برمجة التطبيقات Screenly"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"1cefe8a16e7489b368893c63be6be98e7eb8d2dea595ee6ae193c68ad4d045cd","qualityScore":36}');
