ام دليلنا خطوة بخطوة"},"definition":{"en":"Elasticsearch is a search and analytics engine that enables efficient data retrieval and analysis, using technologies like the Elasticsearch Client and TSVECTOR.","zh":"Elasticsearch是一种开源的搜索和分析引擎，用于处理大规模数据","ja":"Elasticsearchは、大規模なデータを処理するためのオープンソースの検索および分析エンジンです","ko":"Elasticsearch는 대규모 데이터를 처리하기 위한 오픈소스 검색 및 분석 엔진입니다","es":"Elasticsearch es un motor de búsqueda y análisis de datos que permite la indexación y búsqueda de grandes cantidades de datos","fr":"Elasticsearch est un moteur de recherche et d''analyse de données qui permet l''indexation et la recherche de grandes quantités de données","de":"Elasticsearch ist ein Such- und Analysemotor, der die Indizierung und Suche großer Datenmengen ermöglicht","pt":"O que é Elasticsearch? É uma solução de busca e análise de dados","ru":"Что такое Elasticsearch? Это решение для поиска и анализа данных","ar":"ما هو Elasticsearch? هو حل للبحث والتحليل البيانات"},"features":{"en":["Configures Elasticsearch for audit logging and full-text search","Uses the @elastic/elasticsearch Client for setup and configuration","Supports analytics queries and product search beyond PostgreSQL''s TSVECTOR","Enables audit trails for API key access and admin actions","Extends to product search for enhanced data retrieval"],"zh":["支持audit日志和全文搜索","使用Elasticsearch客户端设置","扩展TSVECTOR进行更高级的搜索","支持分析查询","使用Node.js客户端库进行交互"],"ja":["監査ログと全文検索のサポート","Elasticsearchクライアントの設定","TSVECTORの拡張による高度な検索","分析クエリのサポート","Node.jsクライアントライブラリを使用した相互作用"],"ko":["감사 로깅 및 전체 텍스트 검색 지원","Elasticsearch 클라이언트 설정","TSVECTOR 확장による 고급 검색","분석 쿼리 지원","Node.js 클라이언트 라이브러리를 사용한 상호 작용"],"es":["Registro de auditoría con API key y acciones de administrador","Búsqueda de texto completo con TypeScript y Node.js","Consultas analíticas con el cliente de Elasticsearch","Configuración de Elasticsearch con URL y nodo","Uso de la biblioteca @elastic/elasticsearch para Node.js"],"fr":["Journalisation d''audit avec clé API et actions d''administrateur","Recherche de texte complet avec TypeScript et Node.js","Requêtes analytiques avec le client Elasticsearch","Configuration d''Elasticsearch avec URL et nœud","Utilisation de la bibliothèque @elastic/elasticsearch pour Node.js"],"de":["Audit-Protokollierung mit API-Schlüssel und Administrator-Aktionen","Volltextsuche mit TypeScript und Node.js","Analyseanfragen mit dem Elasticsearch-Client","Elasticsearch-Konfiguration mit URL und Knoten","Verwendung der Bibliothek @elastic/elasticsearch für Node.js"],"pt":["Configuração do cliente Elasticsearch com TypeScript","Utilização do Elasticsearch para auditoria e rastreamento de ações de administrador","Extensão do Elasticsearch para busca de produtos além do TSVECTOR do PostgreSQL","Suporte a consultas analíticas e de busca de texto completo","Integração com o Node.js para configuração de URL e autenticação"],"ru":["Настройка клиента Elasticsearch с помощью TypeScript","Использование Elasticsearch для аудита и отслеживания действий администратора","Расширение Elasticsearch для поиска продуктов за пределами TSVECTOR PostgreSQL","Поддержка аналитических запросов и полнотекстового поиска","Интеграция с Node.js для настройки URL и аутентификации"],"ar":["تكوين عميل Elasticsearch باستخدام TypeScript","استخدام Elasticsearch لمراقبة التدقيق وتتبع إجراءات المسؤول","تمديد Elasticsearch للبحث عن المنتجات ما وراء TSVECTOR لبرنامج PostgreSQL","دعم استفسارات التحليلات والبحث النصي الكامل","التكامل مع Node.js لتكوين URL والتحقق"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use elasticsearch","elasticsearch setup guide","elasticsearch vs postgresql","what is elasticsearch","elasticsearch install","elasticsearch alternative","elasticsearch for ai agents","elasticsearch full-text search","elasticsearch analytics queries"],"zh":["Elasticsearch设置","audit日志","全文搜索","分析查询","TSVECTOR","Node.js客户端库","Elasticsearch客户端设置","搜索引擎优化"],"ja":["Elasticsearch設定","監査ログ","全文検索","分析クエリ","TSVECTOR","Node.jsクライアントライブラリ","Elasticsearchクライアント設定","検索エンジン最適化"],"ko":["Elasticsearch 설정","감사 로깅","전체 텍스트 검색","분석 쿼리","TSVECTOR","Node.js 클라이언트 라이브러리","Elasticsearch 클라이언트 설정","검색 엔진 최적화"],"es":["elasticsearch","registro de auditoría","búsqueda de texto completo","consultas analíticas","typescript","node.js","cliente de elasticsearch","configuración de elasticsearch"],"fr":["elasticsearch","journalisation d''audit","recherche de texte complet","requêtes analytiques","typescript","node.js","client elasticsearch","configuration elasticsearch"],"de":["elasticsearch","audit-protokollierung","volltextsuche","analyseanfragen","typescript","node.js","elasticsearch-client","elasticsearch-konfiguration"],"pt":["elasticsearch","typescript","auditoria","busca de texto completo","consultas analíticas","node.js","postgresql","tsvector","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["elasticsearch","typescript","аудит","полнотекстовый поиск","аналитические запросы","node.js","postgresql","tsvector","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты разработки"],"ar":["elasticsearch","typescript","مراقبة التدقيق","البحث النصي الكامل","استفسارات التحليلات","node.js","postgresql","tsvector","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"kaxuna1","repo":"ecomsite","repoPath":"kaxuna1/ecomsite","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.301Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"elasticsearch","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# Elasticsearch Skill\n\nConfigures Elasticsearch for audit logging, full-text search, and analytics queries. This project uses Elasticsearch for audit trails (API key access, admin actions) and could extend to product search beyond PostgreSQL''s TSVECTOR.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### Elasticsearch Client Setup\n\n```typescript\n// src/services/elasticsearchService.ts\nimport { Client } from ''@elastic/elasticsearch'';\n\nconst client = new Client({\n  node: process.env.ELASTICSEARCH_URL || ''http://localhost:9200'',","body":"# Elasticsearch Skill\n\nConfigures Elasticsearch for audit logging, full-text search, and analytics queries. This project uses Elasticsearch for audit trails (API key access, admin actions) and could extend to product search beyond PostgreSQL''s TSVECTOR.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### Elasticsearch Client Setup\n\n```typescript\n// src/services/elasticsearchService.ts\nimport { Client } from ''@elastic/elasticsearch'';\n\nconst client = new Client({\n  node: process.env.ELASTICSEARCH_URL || ''http://localhost:9200'',\n  auth: {\n    apiKey: process.env.ELASTICSEARCH_API_KEY\n  }\n});\n\nexport async function indexAuditEvent(event: AuditEvent): Promise<void> {\n  await client.index({\n    index: `audit-logs-${new Date().toISOString().slice(0, 7)}`, // Monthly indices\n    document: {\n      ...event,\n      ''@timestamp'': new Date().toISOString()\n    }\n  });\n}\n```\n\n### Searching Audit Logs\n\n```typescript\nexport async function searchAuditLogs(params: {\n  keyName?: string;\n  action?: string;\n  adminUserId?: number;\n  from?: string;\n  to?: string;\n  limit?: number;\n}): Promise<AuditEvent[]> {\n  const must: any[] = [];\n  \n  if (params.keyName) must.push({ term: { ''key_name.keyword'': params.keyName } });\n  if (params.action) must.push({ term: { action: params.action } });\n  if (params.adminUserId) must.push({ term: { admin_user_id: params.adminUserId } });\n  \n  if (params.from || params.to) {\n    must.push({\n      range: {\n        ''@timestamp'': {\n          ...(params.from && { gte: params.from }),\n          ...(params.to && { lte: params.to })\n        }\n      }\n    });\n  }\n\n  const response = await client.search({\n    index: ''audit-logs-*'',\n    query: { bool: { must } },\n    size: params.limit || 100,\n    sort: [{ ''@timestamp'': ''desc'' }]\n  });\n\n  return response.hits.hits.map(hit => hit._source as AuditEvent);\n}\n```\n\n## Key Concepts\n\n| Concept | Usage | Example |\n|---------|-------|---------|\n| Index per time period | Prevents unbounded index growth | `audit-logs-2025-01` |\n| Keyword vs text | `.keyword` for exact match, text for full-text | `key_name.keyword` |\n| Bool queries | Combine must/should/must_not clauses | `{ bool: { must: [...] } }` |\n| Date range | Filter by timestamp | `range: { ''@timestamp'': { gte, lte } }` |\n| Aggregations | Analytics and metrics | `aggs: { by_action: { terms: { field: ''action'' } } }` |\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Index Template for Audit Logs\n\n```typescript\nawait client.indices.putIndexTemplate({\n  name: ''audit-logs-template'',\n  index_patterns: [''audit-logs-*''],\n  template: {\n    settings: {\n      number_of_shards: 1,\n      number_of_replicas: 0, // Dev; use 1+ in production\n      ''index.lifecycle.name'': ''audit-logs-policy''\n    },\n    mappings: {\n      properties: {\n        ''@timestamp'': { type: ''date'' },\n        key_name: { type: ''keyword'' },\n        action: { type: ''keyword'' },\n        admin_user_id: { type: ''integer'' },\n        admin_user_email: { type: ''keyword'' },\n        ip_address: { type: ''ip'' },\n        user_agent: { type: ''text'' },\n        metadata: { type: ''object'', enabled: false }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n});\n```\n\n### Aggregation for Analytics\n\n```typescript\nconst response = await client.search({\n  index: ''audit-logs-*'',\n  size: 0,\n  aggs: {\n    actions_over_time: {\n      date_histogram: {\n        field: ''@timestamp'',\n        calendar_interval: ''day''\n      },\n      aggs: {\n        by_action: { terms: { field: ''action'' } }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n});\n```\n\n## See Also\n\n- [patterns](references/patterns.md) - Index design, query patterns, bulk operations\n- [workflows](references/workflows.md) - Setup, monitoring, troubleshooting\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- See the **postgresql** skill for hybrid search strategies (Elasticsearch + PostgreSQL)\n- See the **docker** skill for Elasticsearch container configuration\n- See the **node** skill for async client patterns"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:01:35.463Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Data Analysis Agents needing advanced full-text search and analytics query capabilities with Elasticsearch","zh":"非常适合需要高级全文搜索和分析查询能力的数据分析代理，特别是那些需要使用Elasticsearch的代理","ja":"Elasticsearchを使用して高度なフルテキスト検索および分析クエリ機能を必要とするデータ分析エージェントに最適","ko":"Elasticsearch를 사용하여 고급 전체 텍스트 검색 및 분석 쿼리 기능을 필요로 하는 데이터 분석 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Análisis de Datos que necesitan búsqueda de texto completo avanzada y capacidades de consulta de análisis con Elasticsearch","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''analyse de données nécessitant une recherche de texte complet avancée et des capacités de requête d''analyse avec Elasticsearch","de":"Perfekt für Data Analysis Agents, die erweiterte Volltextsuche- und Analyseabfragefunktionen mit Elasticsearch benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de Dados que necessitam de capacidades de pesquisa de texto completo avançadas e de consultas de análise com Elasticsearch","ru":"Идеально для агентов анализа данных, которым требуются расширенные возможности полнотекстового поиска и запросов аналитики с Elasticsearch","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تحليل البيانات التي تحتاج إلى إمكانيات بحث نص كامل متقدمة وقدرات استعلام تحليلي مع Elasticsearch"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to configure Elasticsearch for audit logging, full-text search, and analytics queries using the @elastic/elasticsearch client, enabling efficient data retrieval and analysis with features like TSVECTOR","zh":"赋予代理配置Elasticsearch用于审计日志、全文搜索和分析查询的能力，使用@elastic/elasticsearch客户端，实现高效的数据检索和分析，支持TSVECTOR等功能","ja":"@elastic/elasticsearchクライアントを使用して、監査ログ、フルテキスト検索、分析クエリのためのElasticsearchの設定をエージェントに可能にし、TSVECTORなどの機能を備えた効率的なデータの取得と分析を実現","ko":"@elastic/elasticsearch 클라이언트를 사용하여 감사 로깅, 전체 텍스트 검색 및 분석 쿼리를 위한 Elasticsearch 설정을 에이전트에 가능하게 하며, TSVECTOR 등의 기능을 통해 효율적인 데이터 검색 및 분석을 구현","es":"Habilita a los agentes a configurar Elasticsearch para registro de auditoría, búsqueda de texto completo y consultas de análisis utilizando el cliente @elastic/elasticsearch, lo que permite una recuperación y análisis de datos eficientes con características como TSVECTOR","fr":"Permet aux agents de configurer Elasticsearch pour la journalisation d''audit, la recherche de texte complet et les requêtes d''analyse en utilisant le client @elastic/elasticsearch, permettant une récupération et une analyse de données efficaces avec des fonctionnalités comme TSVECTOR","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Elasticsearch für Audit-Protokollierung, Volltextsuche und Analyseabfragen mit dem @elastic/elasticsearch-Client zu konfigurieren, wodurch eine effiziente Datenabruf und -analyse mit Funktionen wie TSVECTOR ermöglicht wird","pt":"Habilita os agentes a configurar o Elasticsearch para registro de auditoria, pesquisa de texto completo e consultas de análise usando o cliente @elastic/elasticsearch, permitindo a recuperação e análise eficientes de dados com recursos como TSVECTOR","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью настроить Elasticsearch для ведения аудита, полнотекстового поиска и запросов аналитики с помощью клиента @elastic/elasticsearch, обеспечивая эффективное получение и анализ данных с функциями типа TSVECTOR","ar":"تمكن العميل من تكوين Elasticsearch لتسجيل المحتوى وعمليات البحث النصي الكامل والاستفسارات التحليلية باستخدام عميل @elastic/elasticsearch، وبالتالي تمكين الاسترجاع والتحليل الفعال للبيانات باستخدام ميزات مثل TSVECTOR"},"useCases":{"en":["Configuring Elasticsearch for audit trails and API key access","Implementing full-text search for product search beyond PostgreSQL''s capabilities","Generating analytics queries for data insights"],"zh":["为审计跟踪和API密钥访问配置Elasticsearch","实现超出PostgreSQL能力的产品搜索全文搜索","生成分析查询以获得数据洞察"],"ja":["監査トレイルとAPIキーへのアクセス用にElasticsearchを構成する","PostgreSQLの能力を超えた製品検索用のフルテキスト検索を実装する","データの洞察を得るための分析クエリを生成する"],"ko":["감사 추적 및 API 키 액세스를 위한 Elasticsearch 구성","PostgreSQL의 기능을超越한 제품 검색을 위한 전체 텍스트 검색 구현","데이터洞察를 얻기 위한 분석 쿼리 생성"],"es":["Configuración de Elasticsearch para registros de auditoría y acceso a claves de API","Implementación de búsqueda de texto completo para búsqueda de productos más allá de las capacidades de PostgreSQL","Generación de consultas de análisis para obtener información sobre los datos"],"fr":["Configuration d''Elasticsearch pour les traces d''audit et l''accès aux clés API","Mise en œuvre de la recherche de texte complet pour la recherche de produits au-delà des capacités de PostgreSQL","Génération de requêtes d''analyse pour obtenir des informations sur les données"],"de":["Konfiguration von Elasticsearch für Audit-Verläufe und API-Schlüsselzugriff","Implementierung der Volltextsuche für Produktsuche jenseits der PostgreSQL-Fähigkeiten","Erzeugung von Analyseabfragen zur Gewinnung von Dateninsights"],"pt":["Configurando Elasticsearch para rastros de auditoria e acesso à chave de API","Implementando pesquisa de texto completo para pesquisa de produtos além das capacidades do PostgreSQL","Gerando consultas de análise para insights de dados"],"ru":["Настройка Elasticsearch для аудита и доступа к ключу API","Реализация полнотекстового поиска для поиска продуктов за пределами возможностей PostgreSQL","Генерация запросов аналитики для получения информации о данных"],"ar":["تكوين Elasticsearch لمراقبة سجلات المحتوى ووصول المفتاح API","تنفيذ البحث النصي الكامل للبحث عن المنتجات بما يتجاوز قدرات PostgreSQL","توليد استفسارات التحليل للحصول على اطلاعات حول البيانات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Elasticsearch node setup","Dependent on @elastic/elasticsearch client library"],"zh":["需要Elasticsearch节点设置","依赖@elastic/elasticsearch客户端库"],"ja":["Elasticsearchノードの設定が必要","@elastic/elasticsearchクライアントライブラリに依存"],"ko":["Elasticsearch 노드 설정이 필요","@elastic/elasticsearch 클라이언트 라이브러리에 의존"],"es":["Requiere configuración del nodo Elasticsearch","Dependiente de la biblioteca de cliente @elastic/elasticsearch"],"fr":["Nécessite la configuration d''un nœud Elasticsearch","Dépend de la bibliothèque de client @elastic/elasticsearch"],"de":["Erfordert die Einrichtung eines Elasticsearch-Knotens","Abhängig von der @elastic/elasticsearch-Client-Bibliothek"],"pt":["Exige configuração do nó Elasticsearch","Dependente da biblioteca de cliente @elastic/elasticsearch"],"ru":["Требует настройки узла Elasticsearch","Зависит от библиотеки клиента @elastic/elasticsearch"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد عقدة Elasticsearch","يعتمد على مكتبة عميل @elastic/elasticsearch"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"a8d89f236331338f3e98997cc59e49a82d831a8284814cfd0e5c7969d30c83d0","qualityScore":36}');
