INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('alexanderop/workoutTracker/workout-domain', 'workout-domain', 'alexanderop', 'workoutTracker', 'community', 'workout-domain alexanderop workoutTracker community The workout-domain skill enables developers to create structured workout sequences using discriminated unions via `kind`. It benefits fitness application developers and personal trainers. Workout Domain提供块式训练模型，包括强度块、计时块和心血管块等，帮助开发者创建健身应用 ワークアウトドメインは，ブロックベースのワークアウトモデルを提供し，ストレングスブロック，タイムドブロック，カードブロックなどの機能を活用する 운동 도메인은 블록 기반의 운동 모델을 제공하며, 강도 블록, 타이머 블록, 심장 박동 수 블록 등의 기능을 포함하여 개발자들이 운동 애플리케이션을 구축할 수 있도록 합니다 El dominio de entrenamiento permite crear rutinas de ejercicios personalizadas con bloques de fuerza y cardio. Utiliza discriminated unions para definir bloques de entrenamiento Le domaine d''entraînement permet de créer des routines d''exercices personnalisées avec des blocs de force et de cardio. Il utilise des unions discriminées pour définir les blocs d''entraînement Die Workout-Domäne ermöglicht die Erstellung individueller Trainingspläne mit Kraft- und Cardio-Blöcken. Sie verwendet discriminated unions, um Trainingsblöcke zu definieren O domínio de treinamento é uma sequência de blocos de exercícios que utilizam unions discriminadas via ''kind'' Домен тренировок представляет собой последовательность блоков упражнений, использующих дискриминированные объединения через ''kind'' نطاق التدريب هو تسلسل من كتل التمارين التي تستخدم اتحادات محددة عبر ''kind'' how to use workout-domain workout-domain alternative workout-domain setup guide what is workout-domain workout-domain vs fitness apps install workout-domain block-based workout model TypeScript workout domain discriminated unions in workout-domain workout-domain for personal trainers Workout Domain 块式训练模型 健身应用开发 AI工具 区分联合类型 强度块 计时块 心血管块 Supports strength blocks with traditional sets/reps exercises Includes timed blocks such as AmrapBlock, EmomBlock, TabataBlock, and ForTimeBlock Utilizes discriminated unions via `kind` for workout block definition Enables creation of sequences of blocks for comprehensive workouts Defines sets with user-inputted weight as a string Allows for identification of blocks using a unique `id` number workout-domain is a technical framework for creating block-based workout models, utilizing TypeScript and discriminated unions to define workout sequences.');
