cripts/init-artifact.sh","Desarrollo de artefactos con React 18 y TypeScript","Empaquetado de código con Parcel y Vite","Estilos con Tailwind CSS y shadcn/ui","Opción de pruebas para artefactos"],"fr":["Initialisation du référentiel avec scripts/init-artifact.sh","Développement d''artefacts avec React 18 et TypeScript","Empaquetage de code avec Parcel et Vite","Styles avec Tailwind CSS et shadcn/ui","Option de tests pour les artefacts"],"de":["Initialisierung des Repositoriums mit scripts/init-artifact.sh","Entwicklung von Artefakten mit React 18 und TypeScript","Bündelung von Code mit Parcel und Vite","Stile mit Tailwind CSS und shadcn/ui","Optionale Tests für Artefakte"],"pt":["Criação de artefatos web personalizados com React 18","Utilização de TypeScript para tipagem estática","Otimização de código com Vite","Utilização de Parcel para empacotamento de código","Integração com Tailwind CSS para estilização","Utilização de shadcn/ui para componentes de interface"],"ru":["Создание индивидуальных веб-артефактов с помощью React 18","Использование TypeScript для статической типизации","Оптимизация кода с помощью Vite","Использование Parcel для упаковки кода","Интеграция с Tailwind CSS для стилизации","Использование shadcn/ui для компонентов интерфейса"],"ar":["إنشاء نماذج ويب مخصصة باستخدام React 18","استخدام TypeScript لتعريف أنواع ثابتة","تحسين الكود باستخدام Vite","استخدام Parcel لتحزيم الكود","التكامل مع Tailwind CSS لتصميم الواجهة","استخدام shadcn/ui لمكونات الواجهة"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use awesome:web-artifacts-builder","awesome:web-artifacts-builder setup guide","awesome:web-artifacts-builder vs other frontend builders","what is awesome:web-artifacts-builder","awesome:web-artifacts-builder install","building web artifacts with React and TypeScript"],"zh":["awesome:web-artifacts-builder","前端 AI 工具","React 18","TypeScript","Vite","Tailwind CSS","shadcn/ui","AI 工具构建","前端开发"],"ja":["awesome:web-artifacts-builder","フロントエンド AI エージェント","React 18","TypeScript","Vite","Tailwind CSS","shadcn/ui","AI エージェント構築","フロントエンド開発"],"ko":["awesome:web-artifacts-builder","프론트엔드 AI 도구","React 18","TypeScript","Vite","Tailwind CSS","shadcn/ui","AI 도구 구축","프론트엔드 개발"],"es":["awesome:web-artifacts-builder","herramientas de AI","React 18","TypeScript","Vite","Parcel","Tailwind CSS","shadcn/ui","desarrollo de artefactos web","empaquetado de código"],"fr":["awesome:web-artifacts-builder","outils d''IA","React 18","TypeScript","Vite","Parcel","Tailwind CSS","shadcn/ui","développement d''artefacts web","empaquetage de code"],"de":["awesome:web-artifacts-builder","KI-Tools","React 18","TypeScript","Vite","Parcel","Tailwind CSS","shadcn/ui","Entwicklung von Web-Artefakten","Bündelung von Code"],"pt":["awesome:web-artifacts-builder","criação de artefatos web","React 18","TypeScript","Vite","Parcel","Tailwind CSS","shadcn/ui","desenvolvimento web","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["ИИ Агент awesome:web-artifacts-builder","создание веб-артефактов","React 18","TypeScript","Vite","Parcel","Tailwind CSS","shadcn/ui","веб-разработка","инструменты для разработки"],"ar":["awesome:web-artifacts-builder","إنشاء نماذج ويب","React 18","TypeScript","Vite","Parcel","Tailwind CSS","shadcn/ui","تطوير الويب","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"slavochek2","repo":"claritypledge","repoPath":"slavochek2/claritypledge","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.317Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"awesome:web-artifacts-builder","description":"Suite of tools for creating elaborate, multi-component claude.ai HTML artifacts using modern frontend web technologies (React, Tailwind CSS, shadcn/ui). Use for complex artifacts requiring state management, routing, or shadcn/ui components - not for simple single-file HTML/JSX artifacts.","bodyPreview":"# Web Artifacts Builder\n\nTo build powerful frontend claude.ai artifacts, follow these steps:\n1. Initialize the frontend repo using `scripts/init-artifact.sh`\n2. Develop your artifact by editing the generated code\n3. Bundle all code into a single HTML file using `scripts/bundle-artifact.sh`\n4. Display artifact to user\n5. (Optional) Test the artifact\n\n**Stack**: React 18 + TypeScript + Vite + Parcel (bundling) + Tailwind CSS + shadcn/ui\n\n## Design & Style Guidelines\n\nVERY IMPORTANT: To avoid what","body":"# Web Artifacts Builder\n\nTo build powerful frontend claude.ai artifacts, follow these steps:\n1. Initialize the frontend repo using `scripts/init-artifact.sh`\n2. Develop your artifact by editing the generated code\n3. Bundle all code into a single HTML file using `scripts/bundle-artifact.sh`\n4. Display artifact to user\n5. (Optional) Test the artifact\n\n**Stack**: React 18 + TypeScript + Vite + Parcel (bundling) + Tailwind CSS + shadcn/ui\n\n## Design & Style Guidelines\n\nVERY IMPORTANT: To avoid what is often referred to as \"AI slop\", avoid using excessive centered layouts, purple gradients, uniform rounded corners, and Inter font.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### Step 1: Initialize Project\n\nRun the initialization script to create a new React project:\n```bash\nbash scripts/init-artifact.sh <project-name>\ncd <project-name>\n```\n\nThis creates a fully configured project with:\n- ✅ React + TypeScript (via Vite)\n- ✅ Tailwind CSS 3.4.1 with shadcn/ui theming system\n- ✅ Path aliases (`@/`) configured\n- ✅ 40+ shadcn/ui components pre-installed\n- ✅ All Radix UI dependencies included\n- ✅ Parcel configured for bundling (via .parcelrc)\n- ✅ Node 18+ compatibility (auto-detects and pins Vite version)\n\n### Step 2: Develop Your Artifact\n\nTo build the artifact, edit the generated files. See **Common Development Tasks** below for guidance.\n\n### Step 3: Bundle to Single HTML File\n\nTo bundle the React app into a single HTML artifact:\n```bash\nbash scripts/bundle-artifact.sh\n```\n\nThis creates `bundle.html` - a self-contained artifact with all JavaScript, CSS, and dependencies inlined. This file can be directly shared in Claude conversations as an artifact.\n\n**Requirements**: Your project must have an `index.html` in the root directory.\n\n**What the script does**:\n- Installs bundling dependencies (parcel, @parcel/config-default, parcel-resolver-tspaths, html-inline)\n- Creates `.parcelrc` config with path alias support\n- Builds with Parcel (no source maps)\n- Inlines all assets into single HTML using html-inline\n\n### Step 4: Share Artifact with User\n\nFinally, share the bundled HTML file in conversation with the user so they can view it as an artifact.\n\n### Step 5: Testing/Visualizing the Artifact (Optional)\n\nNote: This is a completely optional step. Only perform if necessary or requested.\n\nTo test/visualize the artifact, use available tools (including other Skills or built-in tools like Playwright or Puppeteer). In general, avoid testing the artifact upfront as it adds latency between the request and when the finished artifact can be seen. Test later, after presenting the artifact, if requested or if issues arise.\n\n## Reference\n\n- **shadcn/ui components**: https://ui.shadcn.com/docs/components"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:02:52.841Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Development Agents needing to generate and bundle React-based web artifacts into single HTML files.","zh":"非常适合需要生成并将基于React的Web构件打包成单个HTML文件的前端开发智能体。","ja":"ReactベースのWebアーティファクトを生成し、単一のHTMLファイルにバンドルする必要があるフロントエンド開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"React 기반 웹 아티팩트를 생성하고 단일 HTML 파일로 번들링해야 하는 프론트엔드 개발 에이전트에 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Desarrollo Frontend que necesitan generar y empaquetar artefactos web basados en React en archivos HTML únicos.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement Frontend qui ont besoin de générer et de bundle des artefacts web basés sur React dans des fichiers HTML uniques.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Entwicklungsagenten, die React-basierte Webartefakte in einzelne HTML-Dateien generieren und bündeln müssen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento Frontend que necessitam gerar e empacotar artefatos web baseados em React em ficheiros HTML únicos.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки интерфейсов, которым необходимо генерировать и собирать веб-артефакты на основе React в единые HTML-файлы.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء تطوير الواجهة الأمامية الذين يحتاجون إلى إنشاء وحزم منتجات ويب قائمة على React في ملفات HTML مفردة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables agents to initialize React 18 + TypeScript + Vite projects and bundle them into deployable HTML artifacts using Parcel. Provides structured development workflows with Tailwind CSS and shadcn/ui components for polished frontend outputs.","zh":"使智能体能够初始化React 18 + TypeScript + Vite项目，并使用Parcel将它们打包成可部署的HTML构件。通过Tailwind CSS和shadcn/ui组件提供结构化开发工作流程，以生成精美的前端输出。","ja":"エージェントがReact 18 + TypeScript + Viteプロジェクトを初期化し、Parcelを使用してデプロイ可能なHTMLアーティファクトにバンドルすることを可能にします。洗練されたフロントエンド出力のために、Tailwind CSSとshadcn/uiコンポーネントを使用した構造化された開発ワークフローを提供します。","ko":"에이전트가 React 18 + TypeScript + Vite 프로젝트를 초기화하고 Parcel을 사용하여 배포 가능한 HTML 아티팩트로 번들링할 수 있게 합니다. 정교한 프론트엔드 출력을 위해 Tailwind CSS 및 shadcn/ui 컴포넌트로 구조화된 개발 워크플로우를 제공합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes inicializar proyectos React 18 + TypeScript + Vite y empaquetarlos en artefactos HTML desplegables utilizando Parcel. Proporciona flujos de trabajo de desarrollo estructurados con Tailwind CSS y componentes shadcn/ui para resultados de frontend pulidos.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''initialiser des projets React 18 + TypeScript + Vite et de les bundle dans des artefacts HTML déployables à l''aide de Parcel. Fournit des flux de travail de développement structurés avec Tailwind CSS et des composants shadcn/ui pour des sorties de frontend polies.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, React 18 + TypeScript + Vite-Projekte zu initialisieren und diese mit Hilfe von Parcel in deploybare HTML-Artefakte zu bündeln. Bietet strukturierte Entwicklungsworkflows mit Tailwind CSS und shadcn/ui-Komponenten für polierte Frontend-Ergebnisse.","pt":"Permite que os agentes inicializem projetos React 18 + TypeScript + Vite e os empacotem em artefatos HTML implantáveis usando Parcel. Fornece fluxos de trabalho estruturados de desenvolvimento com componentes Tailwind CSS e shadcn/ui para resultados frontend polidos.","ru":"Позволяет агентам инициализировать проекты React 18 + TypeScript + Vite и собирать их в развертываемые HTML-артефакты с помощью Parcel. Обеспечивает структурированные рабочие процессы разработки с компонентами Tailwind CSS и shadcn/ui для создания отполированных интерфейсов.","ar":"يمكن الوكلاء من تهيئة مشاريع React 18 + TypeScript + Vite وحزمها في منتجات HTML قابلة للنشر باستخدام Parcel. يوفر سير عمل تطوير منظمًا مع مكونات Tailwind CSS وshadcn/ui للحصول على مخرجات واجهة أمامية مصقولة."},"useCases":{"en":["Initializing React artifact repositories with TypeScript configuration","Bundling complex web applications into single HTML files for distribution","Developing interactive frontend components with Tailwind CSS styling","Generating self-contained web artifacts for Claude.ai integration"],"zh":["使用TypeScript配置初始化React构件仓库","将复杂的Web应用程序打包成单个HTML文件以进行分发","使用Tailwind CSS样式开发交互式前端组件","生成用于Claude.ai集成的自包含Web构件"],"ja":["TypeScript設定を使用したReactアーティファクトリポジトリの初期化","複雑なWebアプリケーションを単一のHTMLファイルにバンドルして配布","Tailwind CSSスタイリングを使用したインタラクティブなフロントエンドコンポーネントの開発","Claude.ai統合のための自己完結型Webアーティファクトの生成"],"ko":["TypeScript 구성을 사용한 React 아티팩트 저장소 초기화","복잡한 웹 애플리케이션을 단일 HTML 파일로 번들링하여 배포","Tailwind CSS 스타일링을 사용한 인터랙티브 프론트엔드 컴포넌트 개발","Claude.ai 통합을 위한 자체 포함 웹 아티팩트 생성"],"es":["Inicializar repositorios de artefactos React con configuración de TypeScript","Empaquetar aplicaciones web complejas en archivos HTML únicos para distribución","Desarrollar componentes de frontend interactivos con estilos de Tailwind CSS","Generar artefactos web autocontenidos para integración con Claude.ai"],"fr":["Initialiser des référentiels d''artefacts React avec une configuration TypeScript","Bundler des applications web complexes en fichiers HTML uniques pour distribution","Développer des composants de frontend interactifs avec des styles Tailwind CSS","Générer des artefacts web autocontenus pour intégration avec Claude.ai"],"de":["Initialisieren von React-Artefakt-Repositorys mit TypeScript-Konfiguration","Bündeln komplexer Webanwendungen in einzelne HTML-Dateien für Verteilung","Entwickeln interaktiver Frontend-Komponenten mit Tailwind CSS-Styling","Generieren selbstenthaltener Webartefakte für Claude.ai-Integration"],"pt":["Inicialização de repositórios de artefatos React com configuração TypeScript","Empacotamento de aplicações web complexas em ficheiros HTML únicos para distribuição","Desenvolvimento de componentes frontend interativos com estilização Tailwind CSS","Geração de artefatos web auto-contidos para integração com Claude.ai"],"ru":["Инициализация репозиториев артефактов React с конфигурацией TypeScript","Сборка сложных веб-приложений в единые HTML-файлы для распространения","Разработка интерактивных интерфейсных компонентов со стилизацией Tailwind CSS","Генерация самодостаточных веб-артефактов для интеграции с Claude.ai"],"ar":["تهيئة مستودعات منتجات React مع تكوين TypeScript","حزم تطبيقات الويب المعقدة في ملفات HTML مفردة للتوزيع","تطوير مكونات واجهة أمامية تفاعلية مع تنسيق Tailwind CSS","إنشاء منتجات ويب مستقلة للتكامل مع Claude.ai"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires shell script execution capabilities","Dependent on Node.js and Parcel bundler environment","Limited to React 18 + TypeScript + Vite technology stack"],"zh":["需要具备Shell脚本执行能力","依赖于Node.js和Parcel打包器环境","仅限于React 18 + TypeScript + Vite技术栈"],"ja":["シェルスクリプト実行機能が必要","Node.jsおよびParcelバンドラー環境に依存","React 18 + TypeScript + Vite技術スタックに限定"],"ko":["셸 스크립트 실행 기능 필요","Node.js 및 Parcel 번들러 환경에 종속됨","React 18 + TypeScript + Vite 기술 스택으로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere capacidades de ejecución de scripts de shell","Dependiente del entorno Node.js y Parcel bundler","Limitado a la pila tecnológica React 18 + TypeScript + Vite"],"fr":["Nécessite des capacités d''exécution de scripts shell","Dépendant de l''environnement Node.js et Parcel bundler","Limité à la pile technologique React 18 + TypeScript + Vite"],"de":["Benötigt Shell-Skript-Ausführungsfähigkeiten","Abhängig von Node.js- und Parcel-Bundler-Umgebung","Begrenzt auf die Technologiestack React 18 + TypeScript + Vite"],"pt":["Requer capacidades de execução de scripts de shell","Dependente do ambiente Node.js e do empacotador Parcel","Limitado à stack tecnológica React 18 + TypeScript + Vite"],"ru":["Требует возможности выполнения shell-скриптов","Зависит от среды Node.js и сборщика Parcel","Ограничено технологическим стеком React 18 + TypeScript + Vite"],"ar":["يتطلب قدرات تنفيذ نصوص shell","يعتمد على بيئة Node.js وأداة الحزم Parcel","مقتصر على مجموعة التقنيات React 18 + TypeScript + Vite"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"7d71c93950d642b05df7389b000b458bdc43306f7d3127f4868d83fcbfcafee5","qualityScore":36}');
