 personal AI assistant framework built with TypeScript, designed for handling complex tasks through a robust agent loop, memory system, and tool integration.","zh":"baoyu-post-to-x 是一个使用 TypeScript 构建的 AI 个人助手框架","ja":"baoyu-post-to-x は、TypeScript で構築された AI エージェント フレームワークです","ko":"baoyu-post-to-x는 TypeScript로 구축된 AI 에이전트 프레임워크입니다","es":"baoyu-post-to-x es un framework de agente de IA que permite la publicación de contenido en X","fr":"baoyu-post-to-x est un framework d''agent IA qui permet la publication de contenu sur X","de":"baoyu-post-to-x ist ein Framework für KI-Agenten, das die Veröffentlichung von Inhalten auf X ermöglicht","pt":"O baoyu-post-to-x é uma ferramenta de postagem automática para X que utiliza TypeScript para criar um assistente pessoal","ru":"ИИ Агент baoyu-post-to-x - это инструмент для автоматической публикации в X, который использует TypeScript для создания личного помощника","ar":"أداة النشر الآلي baoyu-post-to-x هي أداة للنشر التلقائي في X التي تستخدم TypeScript لإنشاء مساعد شخصي"},"features":{"en":["Posts text, images, videos, and long-form articles to Twitter via a real Chrome browser","Bypasses anti-bot detection using a robust agent loop and memory system","Utilizes a TypeScript-based framework for extensibility and customization","Executes scripts located in the `scripts/` subdirectory for flexible automation","Supports agent execution instructions for seamless integration"],"zh":["使用 TypeScript 构建","超轻量级 AI 个人助手框架","通过 Chrome 浏览器发布帖子","支持文本、图片、视频和长篇文章发布","具有强大的代理循环和内存系统"],"ja":["TypeScript で構築","超軽量の AI エージェント フレームワーク","Chrome ブラウザを介して投稿を実行","テキスト、画像、ビデオ、長文記事の投稿をサポート","強力なエージェント ループとメモリ システムを備える"],"ko":["TypeScript로 구축","초경량 AI 에이전트 프레임워크","Chrome 브라우저를 통해 게시물 게시","텍스트, 이미지, 비디오, 장문 기사의 게시를 지원","강력한 에이전트 루프와 메모리 시스템을 갖춤"],"es":["Publicación de texto, imágenes, videos y artículos largos en X","Uso de un navegador Chrome real para evitar la detección de bots","Integración con herramientas y scripts personalizados","Ejecución de scripts en el directorio scripts/","Compatibilidad con TypeScript"],"fr":["Publication de texte, d''images, de vidéos et d''articles longs sur X","Utilisation d''un navigateur Chrome réel pour éviter la détection de bots","Intégration avec des outils et des scripts personnalisés","Exécution de scripts dans le répertoire scripts/","Compatibilité avec TypeScript"],"de":["Veröffentlichung von Text, Bildern, Videos und langen Artikeln auf X","Verwendung eines echten Chrome-Browsers, um die Bot-Erkennung zu vermeiden","Integration mit benutzerdefinierten Tools und Skripten","Ausführung von Skripten im Verzeichnis scripts/","Kompatibilität mit TypeScript"],"pt":["Postagem automática de textos, imagens, vídeos e artigos longos para X","Construída com TypeScript para criar um assistente pessoal","Utiliza um loop de agente robusto e um sistema de memória para lidar com tarefas complexas","Integração com ferramentas para expansão das funcionalidades","Scripts localizados no subdiretório scripts/ para fácil personalização","Suporte à execução de scripts via linha de comando"],"ru":["Автоматическая публикация текстов, изображений, видео и длинных статей в X","Построена на TypeScript для создания личного помощника","Использует прочный агентный цикл и систему памяти для обработки сложных задач","Интеграция с инструментами для расширения функциональности","Скрипты расположены в подпапке scripts/ для легкой настройки","Поддержка выполнения скриптов через командную строку"],"ar":["نشر تلقائي للنصوص والصور والفيديوهات والمقالات الطويلة في X","مبنية على TypeScript لإنشاء مساعد شخصي","تستخدم حلقة وسيطة قوية ونظام ذاكرة لمعالجة المهام المعقدة","تكامل مع الأدوات لتوسيع الوظائف","السكريبتات موجودة في مجلد scripts/ للتعديل السهل","دعم تنفيذ السكريبتات عبر سطر الأوامر"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use baoyu-post-to-x","baoyu-post-to-x alternative","baoyu-post-to-x setup guide","what is baoyu-post-to-x","baoyu-post-to-x vs other AI assistants","baoyu-post-to-x install for developers","baoyu-post-to-x Twitter integration","TypeScript AI assistant framework","ultra-lightweight AI assistant"],"zh":["baoyu-post-to-x","TypeScript AI 个人助手","超轻量级 AI 框架","Chrome 浏览器发布帖子","AI 代理循环","AI 内存系统"],"ja":["baoyu-post-to-x","TypeScript AI エージェント","超軽量の AI フレームワーク","Chrome ブラウザ投稿","AI エージェント ループ","AI メモリ システム"],"ko":["baoyu-post-to-x","TypeScript AI 에이전트","초경량 AI 프레임워크","Chrome 브라우저 게시물 게시","AI 에이전트 루프","AI 메모리 시스템"],"es":["agente de IA","framework de asistente personal","publicación de contenido en X","navegador Chrome real","evitar detección de bots","TypeScript","integración con herramientas","scripts personalizados"],"fr":["agent IA","framework d''agent personnel","publication de contenu sur X","navigateur Chrome réel","éviter la détection de bots","TypeScript","intégration avec des outils","scripts personnalisés"],"de":["KI-Agent","Framework für persönliche KI-Assistenten","Veröffentlichung von Inhalten auf X","echter Chrome-Browser","Vermeidung der Bot-Erkennung","TypeScript","Integration mit benutzerdefinierten Tools","benutzerdefinierte Skripte"],"pt":["baoyu-post-to-x","postagem automática","TypeScript","assistente pessoal","X","não oficial","ferramenta de postagem","automatização de tarefas","desenvolvimento de software","Integração com API"],"ru":["baoyu-post-to-x","автоматическая публикация","TypeScript","личный помощник","X","неофициальный","инструмент для публикации","автоматизация задач","разработка программного обеспечения","Интеграция с API"],"ar":["baoyu-post-to-x","نشر تلقائي","TypeScript","مساعد شخصي","X","غير رسمي","أداة النشر","تأتمة المهام","تطوير البرمجيات","تكامل مع API"]}},"owner":"chengyihua","repo":"nanobot-ts","repoPath":"chengyihua/nanobot-ts","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.320Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"baoyu-post-to-x","description":"Posts content and articles to X (Twitter). Supports regular posts with images/videos and X Articles (long-form Markdown). Uses real Chrome with CDP to bypass anti-automation. Use when user asks to post to X, tweet, publish to Twitter, or share on X.","bodyPreview":"# Post to X (Twitter)\n\nPosts text, images, videos, and long-form articles to X via real Chrome browser (bypasses anti-bot detection).\n\n## Script Directory\n\n**Important**: All scripts are located in the `scripts/` subdirectory of this skill.\n\n**Agent Execution Instructions**:\n1. Determine this SKILL.md file''s directory path as `SKILL_DIR`\n2. Script path = `${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/<script-name>.ts`\n3. Replace all `${SKILL_DIR}` in this document with the actual path\n\n**Script Reference**:\n| Script | P","body":"# Post to X (Twitter)\n\nPosts text, images, videos, and long-form articles to X via real Chrome browser (bypasses anti-bot detection).\n\n## Script Directory\n\n**Important**: All scripts are located in the `scripts/` subdirectory of this skill.\n\n**Agent Execution Instructions**:\n1. Determine this SKILL.md file''s directory path as `SKILL_DIR`\n2. Script path = `${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/<script-name>.ts`\n3. Replace all `${SKILL_DIR}` in this document with the actual path\n\n**Script Reference**:\n| Script | Purpose |\n|--------|---------|\n| `scripts/x-browser.ts` | Regular posts (text + images) |\n| `scripts/x-video.ts` | Video posts (text + video) |\n| `scripts/x-quote.ts` | Quote tweet with comment |\n| `scripts/x-article.ts` | Long-form article publishing (Markdown) |\n| `scripts/md-to-html.ts` | Markdown → HTML conversion |\n| `scripts/copy-to-clipboard.ts` | Copy content to clipboard |\n| `scripts/paste-from-clipboard.ts` | Send real paste keystroke |\n\n## Preferences (EXTEND.md)\n\nUse Bash to check EXTEND.md existence (priority order):\n\n```bash\n# Check project-level first\ntest -f .baoyu-skills/baoyu-post-to-x/EXTEND.md && echo \"project\"\n\n# Then user-level (cross-platform: $HOME works on macOS/Linux/WSL)\ntest -f \"$HOME/.baoyu-skills/baoyu-post-to-x/EXTEND.md\" && echo \"user\"\n```\n\n┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────┬───────────────────┐\n│                       Path                       │     Location      │\n├──────────────────────────────────────────────────┼───────────────────┤\n│ .baoyu-skills/baoyu-post-to-x/EXTEND.md          │ Project directory │\n├──────────────────────────────────────────────────┼───────────────────┤\n│ $HOME/.baoyu-skills/baoyu-post-to-x/EXTEND.md    │ User home         │\n└──────────────────────────────────────────────────┴───────────────────┘\n\n┌───────────┬───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│  Result   │                                  Action                                   │\n├───────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ Found     │ Read, parse, apply settings                                               │\n├───────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ Not found │ Use defaults                                                              │\n└───────────┴───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n\n**EXTEND.md Supports**: Default Chrome profile | Auto-submit preference\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Google Chrome or Chromium\n- `bun` runtime\n- First run: log in to X manually (session saved)\n\n## References\n\n- **Regular Posts**: See `references/regular-posts.md` for manual workflow, troubleshooting, and technical details\n- **X Articles**: See `references/articles.md` for long-form article publishing guide\n\n---\n\n## Regular Posts\n\nText + up to 4 images.\n\n```bash\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/x-browser.ts \"Hello!\" --image ./photo.png          # Preview\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/x-browser.ts \"Hello!\" --image ./photo.png --submit  # Post\n```\n\n**Parameters**:\n| Parameter | Description |\n|-----------|-------------|\n| `<text>` | Post content (positional) |\n| `--image <path>` | Image file (repeatable, max 4) |\n| `--submit` | Post (default: preview) |\n| `--profile <dir>` | Custom Chrome profile |\n\n---\n\n## Video Posts\n\nText + video file.\n\n```bash\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/x-video.ts \"Check this out!\" --video ./clip.mp4          # Preview\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/x-video.ts \"Amazing content\" --video ./demo.mp4 --submit  # Post\n```\n\n**Parameters**:\n| Parameter | Description |\n|-----------|-------------|\n| `<text>` | Post content (positional) |\n| `--video <path>` | Video file (MP4, MOV, WebM) |\n| `--submit` | Post (default: preview) |\n| `--profile <dir>` | Custom Chrome profile |\n\n**Limits**: Regular 140s max, Premium 60min. Processing: 30-60s.\n\n---\n\n## Quote Tweets\n\nQuote an existing tweet with comment.\n\n```bash\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/x-quote.ts https://x.com/user/status/123 \"Great insight!\"          # Preview\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/x-quote.ts https://x.com/user/status/123 \"I agree!\" --submit       # Post\n```\n\n**Parameters**:\n| Parameter | Description |\n|-----------|-------------|\n| `<tweet-url>` | URL to quote (positional) |\n| `<comment>` | Comment text (positional, optional) |\n| `--submit` | Post (default: preview) |\n| `--profile <dir>` | Custom Chrome profile |\n\n---\n\n## X Articles\n\nLong-form Markdown articles (requires X Premium).\n\n```bash\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/x-article.ts article.md                        # Preview\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/x-article.ts article.md --cover ./cover.jpg    # With cover\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/x-article.ts article.md --submit               # Publish\n```\n\n**Parameters**:\n| Parameter | Description |\n|-----------|-------------|\n| `<markdown>` | Markdown file (positional) |\n| `--cover <path>` | Cover image |\n| `--title <text>` | Override title |\n| `--submit` | Publish (default: preview) |\n\n**Frontmatter**: `title`, `cover_image` supported in YAML front matter.\n\n---\n\n## Notes\n\n- First run: manual login required (session persists)\n- Always preview before `--submit`\n- Cross-platform: macOS, Linux, Windows\n\n## Extension Support\n\nCustom configurations via EXTEND.md. See **Preferences** section for paths and supported options.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:02:57.551Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Social Media Agents needing automated Twitter posting capabilities with anti-bot detection bypassing.","zh":"非常适合需要具备自动化Twitter发帖能力并能绕过反机器人检测的社交媒体Agent。","ja":"自動化されたTwitter投稿機能とボット検知回避機能を必要とするソーシャルメディアAgentに最適です。","ko":"자동화된 Twitter 게시 기능과 봇 탐지 회피 기능이 필요한 소셜 미디어 에이전트에 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de medios sociales que necesitan capacidades de publicación automática de Twitter con bypass de detección de bots.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de médias sociaux ayant besoin de capacités de publication automatisée de Twitter avec contournement de la détection des bots.","de":"Perfekt für Social-Media-Agents, die automatisierte Twitter-Posting-Funktionen mit Umgehung der Bot-Erkennung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Mídia Social que necessitam de capacidades de postagem automática do Twitter com bypass de detecção anti-bot.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов социальных сетей, которым необходимы автоматические возможности публикации в Twitter с обходом обнаружения ботов.","ar":"مثالي لعميل وسائل الإعلام الاجتماعية الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات منشورة آلية على تويتر مع تجاوز اكتشاف الروبوتات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to post text, images, videos, and long-form articles to Twitter via a real Chrome browser, utilizing a robust agent loop and memory system, and supporting TypeScript for extensibility.","zh":"通过真实的Chrome浏览器，利用强大的Agent循环和内存系统，支持TypeScript以实现可扩展性，使Agent能够向Twitter发布文本、图像、视频和长篇文章。","ja":"実際のChromeブラウザを介して、強力なAgentループとメモリシステムを利用し、拡張性のためにTypeScriptをサポートすることで、AgentがTwitterにテキスト、画像、動画、長文記事を投稿できるようにします。","ko":"실제 Chrome 브라우저를 통해 강력한 에이전트 루프 및 메모리 시스템을 활용하고 확장성을 위해 TypeScript를 지원하여 에이전트가 Twitter에 텍스트, 이미지, 비디오 및 장문 기사를 게시할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a publicar texto, imágenes, vídeos y artículos de largo formato en Twitter a través de un navegador Chrome real, utilizando un sistema de bucle y memoria robusto, y admitiendo TypeScript para la extensibilidad.","fr":"Permet aux agents de publier du texte, des images, des vidéos et des articles de longue forme sur Twitter via un navigateur Chrome réel, en utilisant une boucle et un système de mémoire robuste, et en prenant en charge TypeScript pour l''extensibilité.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, Text, Bilder, Videos und langformatige Artikel über einen echten Chrome-Browser auf Twitter zu posten, indem es eine robuste Agenten-Schleife und ein Speichersystem nutzt und TypeScript für Erweiterbarkeit unterstützt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a publicar texto, imagens, vídeos e artigos de longa forma no Twitter por meio de um navegador Chrome real, utilizando um loop de agente robusto e sistema de memória, e suportando TypeScript para extensibilidade.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью публиковать текст, изображения, видео и статьи большой длины в Twitter через реальный браузер Chrome, используя прочный цикл агента и систему памяти, и поддерживая TypeScript для расширяемости.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء نشر نصوص، صور، مقاطع فيديو، ومقالات طويلة على تويتر عبر متصفح كروم حقيقي، مع استخدام حلقة وكيل قوية ونظام ذاكرة، ودعم لغة TypeScript للامتداد."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating Twitter content publishing","Posting multimedia content to Twitter","Bypassing anti-bot detection for Twitter posts"],"zh":["自动化Twitter内容发布","向Twitter发布多媒体内容","绕过Twitter帖子的反机器人检测"],"ja":["Twitterコンテンツ公開の自動化","Twitterへのマルチメディアコンテンツの投稿","Twitter投稿のためのボット検知回避"],"ko":["Twitter 콘텐츠 게시 자동화","Twitter에 멀티미디어 콘텐츠 게시","Twitter 게시물에 대한 봇 탐지 회피"],"es":["Automatización de la publicación de contenido en Twitter","Publicación de contenido multimedia en Twitter","Contorneo de la detección de bots para publicaciones de Twitter"],"fr":["Automatisation de la publication de contenu sur Twitter","Publication de contenu multimédia sur Twitter","Contournement de la détection des bots pour les publications Twitter"],"de":["Automatisierung der Twitter-Inhalte-Veröffentlichung","Veröffentlichung von Multimedia-Inhalten auf Twitter","Umfahrung der Bot-Erkennung für Twitter-Beiträge"],"pt":["Automatizar a publicação de conteúdo do Twitter","Publicar conteúdo multimídia no Twitter","Contornar a detecção anti-bot para publicações do Twitter"],"ru":["Автоматизация публикации контента Twitter","Публикация мультимедийного контента в Twitter","Обход обнаружения ботов для публикаций Twitter"],"ar":["تأتمة نشر محتوى تويتر","نشر محتوى多媒体 على تويتر","تجاوز اكتشاف الروبوتات لنشرات تويتر"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Chrome browser installation","TypeScript knowledge required for customization","Limited to Twitter platform"],"zh":["需要安装Chrome浏览器","自定义需要TypeScript知识","仅限于Twitter平台"],"ja":["Chromeブラウザのインストールが必要","カスタマイズにはTypeScriptの知識が必要","Twitterプラットフォームに限定"],"ko":["Chrome 브라우저 설치 필요","사용자 정의를 위해 TypeScript 지식 필요","Twitter 플랫폼으로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere la instalación del navegador Chrome","Conocimiento de TypeScript necesario para la personalización","Limitado a la plataforma Twitter"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation du navigateur Chrome","Connaissances de TypeScript requises pour la personnalisation","Limité à la plateforme Twitter"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation des Chrome-Browsers","TypeScript-Kenntnisse erforderlich für Anpassungen","Begrenzt auf die Twitter-Plattform"],"pt":["Requer instalação do navegador Chrome","Conhecimento de TypeScript necessário para personalização","Limitado à plataforma Twitter"],"ru":["Требуется установка браузера Chrome","Необходимо знание TypeScript для настройки","Ограничен платформой Twitter"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت متصفح كروم","معلومات لغة TypeScript ضرورية للتعديل","محدود بمنصة تويتر"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"4522ae2cfa2a7c79dfdce9f84be9f6541cdc36f5e234daff762f756faf614ebb","qualityScore":36}');
